@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminToken = 从本地 Keycloak 获取的 Bearer Token
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@keyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@apiKey = vsk_test_public-key-id.secret

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### 创建应用
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "内容服务",
  "environment": "test"
}

### 查询应用列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 查询应用详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 创建应用 API Key，只在响应中展示一次明文
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiresAt": "2027-03-01T00:00:00Z",
  "scopes": ["moderation:submit", "moderation:read"]
}

### 查询应用 API Key 脱敏列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 轮换应用 API Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}/api-keys/{{keyId}}/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiresAt": "2027-03-01T00:00:00Z",
  "revokeOldKey": false,
  "scopes": ["moderation:submit", "moderation:read"]
}

### 撤销应用 API Key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}/api-keys/{{keyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 提交批量审核
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/moderation/batches
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "sync",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "item-001",
      "content": "待审核文本",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "contentType": "plain_text"
    }
  ]
}

### 查询审核批次
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/moderation/batches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
